From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mythiccal <cwood2014.cw@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 16:21:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Parallel world ticking

Per-world tick thread checks and Bukkit tick-time accessors for SparklyPaper parallel world ticking.

diff --git a/src/main/java/ca/spottedleaf/moonrise/common/list/IteratorSafeOrderedReferenceSet.java b/src/main/java/ca/spottedleaf/moonrise/common/list/IteratorSafeOrderedReferenceSet.java
